1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,202
Warm. Thank you for calling
Sunnyside Leisure Center.

2
00:00:03,226 --> 00:00:07,518
Please listen carefully, as some of
our information has recently changed.

3
00:00:07,542 --> 00:00:10,892
The center is open seven days
a week, and from this month,

4
00:00:11,040 --> 00:00:13,604
the doors open an hour
earlier than before, at

5
00:00:13,628 --> 00:00:16,092
seven in the morning.
Swimmers, please note,

6
00:00:16,500 --> 00:00:19,138
the pool is unavailable
in the middle of the week,

7
00:00:19,162 --> 00:00:21,807
on Wednesdays, while it
is cleaned. On every other

8
00:00:21,808 --> 00:00:24,718
day, it's open as normal.
Standard gym membership

9
00:00:24,742 --> 00:00:28,244
is 25 pounds a month, and
there's no long contract to sign.

10
00:00:28,245 --> 00:00:30,424
Drivers can leave
their car in our car

11
00:00:30,448 --> 00:00:33,452
park free of charge for
up to two hours. After that,

12
00:00:33,600 --> 00:00:36,309
charges apply. The gym
is on the ground floor,

13
00:00:36,333 --> 00:00:39,231
while the sports hall is
up one flight of stairs,

14
00:00:39,390 --> 00:00:41,830
on the first floor. Our
cafe opens at 10, and

15
00:00:41,854 --> 00:00:44,252
hot food is served
until six in the evening.

16
00:00:44,645 --> 00:00:46,865
Children's swimming
lessons take place every

17
00:00:46,889 --> 00:00:49,172
Saturday morning,
and places fill up quickly.

18
00:00:49,620 --> 00:00:52,328
Lockers take a one-pound
coin, which you get back when

19
00:00:52,352 --> 00:00:54,867
you return the key.
Visitors with limited mobility

20
00:00:54,868 --> 00:00:57,208
should use the side
entrance, which has a ramp,

21
00:00:57,232 --> 00:00:59,592
rather than the main
doors. To speak to someone

22
00:00:59,680 --> 00:01:03,198
at reception, please
call 01632-960-582.

23
00:01:03,222 --> 00:01:07,680
Junior membership, at a
reduced price, is available

24
00:01:07,681 --> 00:01:10,458
to anyone who is under
18. Rackets can be hired

25
00:01:10,482 --> 00:01:13,207
from reception for three
pounds, and if you've

26
00:01:13,208 --> 00:01:16,048
forgotten your towel, you
can hire one for two pounds.

27
00:01:16,072 --> 00:01:18,412
From Monday to Saturday,
we close at 10 p.m.

28
00:01:18,413 --> 00:01:21,438
, but on Sundays, the
center closes much earlier, at

29
00:01:21,462 --> 00:01:24,512
5. Group fitness classes,
such as spin and pilates,

30
00:01:24,779 --> 00:01:27,508
now take place in studio
two, as studio one is

31
00:01:27,532 --> 00:01:30,387
closed for refurbishment.
Regular visitors might

32
00:01:30,388 --> 00:01:32,798
like our season tickets,
which last for 12 months

33
00:01:32,822 --> 00:01:35,252
from the day you buy
them. The sauna can be found

34
00:01:35,339 --> 00:01:37,647
right beside the pool,
through the double doors.

35
00:01:37,671 --> 00:01:40,507
If you need help, look out
for our staff in blue uniforms.

36
00:01:40,508 --> 00:01:42,563
Our fitness
instructors wear black.

37
00:01:42,587 --> 00:01:46,032
Classes and pool sessions can
be booked online up to a week,

38
00:01:46,259 --> 00:01:48,462
that's seven days,
before your visit.

39
00:01:48,486 --> 00:01:52,212
Finally, any lost property is
kept at reception for four weeks,

40
00:01:52,429 --> 00:01:56,320
after which it is given to charity. Thank
you for calling Sunnyside Leisure Center,

41
00:01:56,569 --> 00:01:58,129
and we look forward to seeing you soon!

